    "created_at": "2020-09-29T00:05:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-09-29T00:05:32Z",
    "body": "yeah, I agree. That's a better question. A few things I can think of... the \"[distraction free writing](https://make.wordpress.org/support/user-manual/content/editors/distraction-free-writing/)\" mode like in WordPress... I might get up to make a coffee in the middle of writing, so I'd probably don't want it to hold a wake lock. \r\n\r\nSimilarly, I think VS Code has a similar \"zen\" mode. Again, I might be in Zen mode, but might get up to do something (e.g., rest room, answer the door or phone) - so I probably don't want it to hold a wake lock there. ",
